      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<size=124><b>Life Under Pressure</b></size>


    <size=80>by BEN</size>



    <size=46><b>Henrik
    Aasvik </b></size>- Team Leader | 3d Artist


    <size=46><b>Erik Green Leth-Olsen
    </b></size>- 3d Artist


    <size=46><b>Eirik Smith Olsen </b></size>- 3d Artist


    <size=46><b>Aleksis
    Bojaruns </b></size>- Gameplay/Generalist Programmer


    <size=46><b>Uliana
    Sechkar </b></size>- Game Programmer


    <size=46><b>Javier Murillo Gonzalez
    </b></size>- Graphics Programmer | Project Manager


    <size=46><b>Paula Roman
    Lopez </b></size>- Game Programmer


    <size=46><b>Janko Zorbas </b></size>-
    Sound Producer | Audio Designer


    <size=46><b>Danu Ioann Pumnea </b></size>-
    Sound Producer | UI Artist


    <size=46><b>Tobias Haugstad </b></size>- Game
    Designer




    Special thanks to our diving crew that fearlessly explored 95%
    of the world ocean to provide us with the unique information to make this game
    possible.



    Protect our World, Save Our world.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
